    "/us/en/c/2018/guaranteeprograms": { "template": "tier2-landing-page", "metadata": { "title": "Guarantee Programs", "pageTitle": "Support", "description": "Ask our experts about our risk-sharing programs for long-term financial investment and how we can help lift the burden off your back.", "image": "/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/PIT-thumbnail-3.png", "imageAlt": null, "tags": ["stryker:business-unit/acute-care"], "originallyPublished": null, "lastPublished": "2023-10-24T18:25:23.000Z", "contentID": "Mkt Lit-1663 13 SEP 2018 REV A" }, "anchors": [], "disclaimer": '<p>1.<span> Russo, C .A ., Steiner, C . and Spector, W. (2008). Hospitalizations related to Pressure Ulcers, 2006. HCUP Statistical Brief #64. December 2008. Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality, Rockville, MD.&nbsp;<a href="http://www.hcup-us.ahrq.gov/reports/statbriefs/sb64.pdf">http://www.hcup-us.ahrq.gov/reports/statbriefs/sb64.pdf</a></span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>2. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the 30% HAPI Reduction contract, the Rental Reduction contract, or the iBed Wireless Fall Reduction Contract. iBed Wireless System includes iBed Radios, iBed Locators, and a Stryker server application.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>3. Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality, Rockville, MD. Nurse -driven early mobility protocols: Slide presentation. Content last reviewed January 2017. Retrieved from <a href="http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/quality-patient-safety/hais/tools/mvp/modules/technical/nursedr-early-mobility-protocols-slides.html">http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/quality-patient-safety/hais/tools/mvp/modules/technical/nursedr-early-mobility-protocols-slides.html</a></p>\r\n<p>4. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the iBed Wireless Fall Reduction Contract. iBed Wireless System includes iBed Radios, iBed Locators, and a Stryker server application.</p>\r\n<p>5. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the HAPI Reduction contract. Must include advanced clinical hours. Support surfaces include Isolibrium, IsoFlex, and IsoAir.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>6. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the Rental Reduction contract.</p>\r\n<p>7. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the Stryker Fall Reduction contract.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>* Burns, E. R., Stevens, J. A., &amp; Lee, R. (2016). The direct costs of fatal and non-fatal falls among older adults\u2014United States. Journal of Safety Research, 58, 99-103.doi:10.1016/j.jsr.2016.05.001<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>** Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality, Rockville, MD. Are we ready for this change? Last reviewed in October 2014. Retrieved from:&nbsp;<a href="http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/systems/hospital/pressureulcertoolkit/putool1.html">http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/systems/hospital/pressureulcertoolkit/putool1.html</a><br>\r\n</p>', "forms": [], "tabs": [], "cardLists": [], "missingAlt": ["/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/learning_learning_guaranteePrograms.jpg", "/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/calculator_guaranteePrograms.jpg"] },
    "/us/en/c/2018/more-power-to-you": { "template": "tier2-landing-page", "metadata": { "title": "More power to you", "pageTitle": "More power to you", "description": "Description", "image": null, "imageAlt": null, "tags": [], "originallyPublished": null, "lastPublished": "2021-04-19T18:13:39.000Z", "contentID": "Mkt Lit-1712 19 DEC 2018 REV A" }, "anchors": [], "disclaimer": "<p>1. Please contact your sales representative to see if you qualify for the EMS Guarantee.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n2. Subject to the terms and conditions of EMS Guarantee agreement.</p>\r\n<p>3. Emergency Medical Services Authority. (2015). Risk Reduction Success Story: Utilization of the Stryker Power-LOAD Cot Fastener System in the EMSA System. Tulsa, Oklahoma and Oklahoma City, Oklahoma.: Emergency Medical Services Authority. *Data provided by EMSA.</p>\r\n<p>4.&nbsp;Reference: Stryker. (2012). Superior Ambulance Case Study [Case Study on Power-PRO XT cots]. Retrieved from: http://ems.stryker.com</p>", "forms": [{ "formId": "584", "afterSubmitAction": "redirectToPage", "message": null, "useProduction": true }], "tabs": [], "cardLists": [], "missingAlt": ["/content/dam/stryker/campaigns/ems_mpty/images/2018_re_LOAD_flex_lady.jpg"] },
